OL,3,GNEWSAMum's tribute to 'beautiful boy'
OL,4,Awho died in alleged attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man who died in
OL,7,Fhospital in Dundee after being
OL,8,Fseriously injured in Arbroath has paid
OL,9,Ftribute to her "beautiful boy".
OL,11,FReece Massie, from Dundee, was
OL,12,Fdiscovered in the grounds of Ninewells
OL,13,FHospital shortly after 03:45 on Sunday,
OL,14,Fbut died shortly afterwards.
OL,16,FJayden Gray, 25, appeared in private at
OL,17,FForfar Sheriff Court on Tuesday accused
OL,18,Fof murdering the 21-year-old.
OL,20,FReece's mother Leanne Boath said that
OL,21,Fher son was "my whole life" and she had
OL,22,Fbeen "left heartbroken."
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
